{%- comment -%}
  Paste this into the "Quadrant" tab of the bus-grabo plugin's Edit Markup
  screen (separate from the "Full" tab's template.liquid). Compact version
  for small Mashup panes: each board gets one row with its icon on the left
  (framing the two departure lines like a small departure board) + line/time
  for ETD and Nästa, plus a "Senaste position" (last seen) row - a
  real nearest bus stop name + timestamp, shown even for a sighting from
  that line running a different direction or route variant, always
  populated once any GPS sighting has ever been recorded (see fetch.mjs's
  nearestStopName() and buildLastSeen()). No separate map image here (a
  Quadrant pane is too narrow for the 480px-wide position map to be legible
  - that stays on the Full view only).

  LAYOUT (per board): ONE table per board, three rows, one shared left
  column (the same ~48px column the icon always used):
    1. bus icon (top-left corner of the board)  |  "MJÖRN > GRÅBO" text
    2. line badge (525 / X3)                    |  boxed ETD  |  boxed Nästa
    3. line badge (525 / X3) + "Senaste position: ..."  (colspan=3, so the
       text runs the full pane width, same as before)
  So each board reads top to bottom as: icon + route, then "<line> + times"
  (the journey), then "<line> + last seen", with the icon and both line
  badges stacked in the same left column. Both badges start at the pane's
  left edge, i.e. the journey badge and the last-seen badge line up exactly.
  Previously the badge sat in the header row (pushed right by the icon
  column) while the last-seen line was a separate full-width <div> below the
  table starting at x=0, so the two badges were ~50px out of line, and the
  icon was vertically centered beside the header+times rows instead of at
  the board's top-left. The last-seen line also used to be its own flex
  child (an extra gap--small) - it is now a table row, which saves two gaps
  of height in the fixed-height pane. Badge in the "Ingen avgång" case still
  shows, so a board with no departure keeps its line badge.

  Icon direction: see template.liquid's comment - icons are drawn nose-first
  towards the right, so placed at the left edge they read as driving into
  the departure lines next to them.

  Same rules as template.liquid: every text line uses "label" so size/font
  stays identical and pixelated throughout; each icon <img> is a single LONE
  <img>, sitting inside its own table cell (plain <table>/<td>, not TRMNL's
  styled table component) - a bare <div class="layout layout--row"> wrapper
  let the surrounding layout stretch an icon into a tall narrow sliver
  instead of its real landscape shape on a real device, table cells don't
  have that problem.

  Line badge: a small black-background/white-text <span> with the board's
  line number (525 or X3) - in the left column of the times row (next to
  the boxed ETD/Nästa), and again at the start of the "Senaste position"
  line, so it's clear at a glance which line each row is about (template.
  liquid puts it beside its own header text instead - see its comment for
  why the badge exists at all).
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="layout layout--col gap--small">

  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 48px; border: none; padding: 0 6px 0 0; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;">
        <img class="image image--contain image-dither" src="{{ mjorn_to_grabo.icon_url }}" width="44" height="22" style="width: 44px; height: 22px; display: block;">
      </td>
      <td colspan="2" style="border: none; padding: 0; text-align: left; vertical-align: middle;"><div class="label">MJÖRN &gt; GRÅBO</div></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="border: none; padding: 0 6px 0 0; text-align: left; vertical-align: middle;"><div class="label"><span style="background: #000; color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 1px 6px; margin-right: 0;">{{ mjorn_to_grabo.line }}</span></div></td>
      {% if mjorn_to_grabo.has_departure %}
      <td style="border: 1px solid #000; padding: 1px 6px; text-align: center;"><div class="label">{{ mjorn_to_grabo.estimated_time }}{% if mjorn_to_grabo.delay_minutes > 0 %} (+{{ mjorn_to_grabo.delay_minutes }}){% endif %}</div></td>
      {% if mjorn_to_grabo.next_departure_time %}
      <td style="border: 1px solid #000; padding: 1px 6px; text-align: center;"><div class="label">{{ mjorn_to_grabo.next_departure_time }}</div></td>
      {% else %}
      <td style="border: none;"></td>
      {% endif %}
      {% else %}
      <td colspan="2" style="border: none; padding: 1px 6px; text-align: center;"><div class="label">Ingen avgång</div></td>
      {% endif %}
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td colspan="3" style="border: none; padding: 3px 0 0 0; text-align: left;"><div class="label"><span style="background: #000; color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 1px 6px; margin-right: 4px;">{{ mjorn_to_grabo.line }}</span>Senaste position: {{ mjorn_to_grabo.last_seen.location_text }} ({{ mjorn_to_grabo.last_seen.seen_at_display }})</div></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 48px; border: none; padding: 0 6px 0 0; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;">
        <img class="image image--contain image-dither" src="{{ grabo_to_goteborg.icon_url }}" width="44" height="22" style="width: 44px; height: 22px; display: block;">
      </td>
      <td colspan="2" style="border: none; padding: 0; text-align: left; vertical-align: middle;"><div class="label">GRÅBO &gt; GÖTEBORG</div></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="border: none; padding: 0 6px 0 0; text-align: left; vertical-align: middle;"><div class="label"><span style="background: #000; color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 1px 6px; margin-right: 0;">{{ grabo_to_goteborg.line }}</span></div></td>
      {% if grabo_to_goteborg.has_departure %}
      <td style="border: 1px solid #000; padding: 1px 6px; text-align: center;"><div class="label">{{ grabo_to_goteborg.estimated_time }}{% if grabo_to_goteborg.delay_minutes > 0 %} (+{{ grabo_to_goteborg.delay_minutes }}){% endif %}</div></td>
      {% if grabo_to_goteborg.next_departure_time %}
      <td style="border: 1px solid #000; padding: 1px 6px; text-align: center;"><div class="label">{{ grabo_to_goteborg.next_departure_time }}</div></td>
      {% else %}
      <td style="border: none;"></td>
      {% endif %}
      {% else %}
      <td colspan="2" style="border: none; padding: 1px 6px; text-align: center;"><div class="label">Ingen avgång</div></td>
      {% endif %}
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td colspan="3" style="border: none; padding: 3px 0 0 0; text-align: left;"><div class="label"><span style="background: #000; color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 1px 6px; margin-right: 4px;">{{ grabo_to_goteborg.line }}</span>Senaste position: {{ grabo_to_goteborg.last_seen.location_text }} ({{ grabo_to_goteborg.last_seen.seen_at_display }})</div></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

</div>

<div class="title_bar">
  <span class="title">Bussar</span>
  <span class="instance">{{ updated_display }}</span>
</div>
